- GitHub: clean, GitHub-ready repo (.gitignore, README, sensible commits structure guidance).
- Vercel: compatible deployment (static output), documented steps, document any environment variables (likely none). No secrets in client code.

Architecture rule: these technologies must coexist without duplicated functionality or style conflicts. Explain the architecture and the purpose of each technology in the README.

